word | band | area | meaning:en | forms
# Core words: the small words every sentence needs, and common verbs, adjectives and adverbs with no one theme.
# Forms are what the reader can save: words joined by an apostrophe or hyphen are one word ("aujourd'hui", "arc-en-ciel").

